      Attack","body":"When the state is triggered, allow attacks again by resetting
      the once node, just in case. Also resets the position of the laser renderer.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"30293e74-4f39-4f05-805a-875b6f50c474","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-44.0,"yMin":-634.0,"xMax":247.0,"yMax":-526.6667},"title":"Drone
      Attack","body":"The most spaghetti script I have ever written. This script
      controls the attack drone''s attack, which involves the drone pausing, changing
      colour, and shooting a laser at where the player was when it paused.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"3d34e5f0-4f91-4456-9e6f-b398869b426a","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":37.0,"yMin":-87.0,"xMax":218.0,"yMax":2.333313},"title":"Drone
      Attack","body":"Store the player''s position at time of attack and move towards
      the player, but stay at the same y level.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"0e758c94-4b0e-46a5-a244-21a37c5a02f8","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":1303.0,"yMin":-365.0,"xMax":1442.0,"yMax":-274.0},"title":"Drone
      Attack","body":"Get the player''s position relative to the drone''s laser for
      rendering.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"cf092e96-318c-4556-b412-98a053ec0de9","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":2109.0,"yMin":-300.0,"xMax":2314.0,"yMax":-196.6667},"title":"Drone
      Attack","body":"Raycast to determine if the drone''s laser hits the player.
      This raycast, like the enemies'' sight one, seems to have trouble seeing walls.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"b07dea4e-dab1-4a37-835d-afab2750dad1","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":2642.0,"yMin":-480.6666,"xMax":2756.0,"yMax":-400.6666},"title":"Drone
      Attack","body":"If the raycast hit the player, hurt them.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"a0874d62-38f9-45d1-aa6a-14436a1c47a6","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":1898.0,"yMin":-50.0,"xMax":2068.0,"yMax":29.0},"title":"Drone
      Attack","body":"Fade from yellow to red over the timer to show the drone charging.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"b6b49d1c-b103-4bdd-b174-6b98b26b66bd","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":1570.0,"yMin":-45.0,"xMax":1723.0,"yMax":44.0},"title":"Drone
